  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 119967817728
    m_Localized: Click Any Button
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 427288666112
    m_Localized: "Welcome to Excroaalibur\u2019s first demo !\n\nHere, your goal
      is to get the Sword on the altar and to survive as much waves of enemies as
      possible by killing them by throwing the Sword at them. But be careful not
      loosing it, because the enemies will try to get it back to the altar, making
      you lose.\n\nTo start your turn, push the altar to get the Sword !"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2083535429632
    m_Localized: "Your character has various possible actions per turn : Moving,
      Pushing (if you don\u2019t have the Sword) and Throwing the Sword.\n\nEach
      of your characters can do 2 actions per turn. When every character of yours
      used all their action points, your turn will end and the enemies will take
      their turn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2696918835200
    m_Localized: "If you kill an enemy with the Sword, it will get back to the thrower
      instantly, but if it doesn\u2019t, it will bounce just in front of them.\n\nEach
      time you pass the Sword between your characters, it will grow in power by 1,
      allowing you to kill stronger enemies. \n\nIts power resets after a kill or
      after it\u2019s thrown but not passed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3020303867904
    m_Localized: 'When every enemies of the actual wave are eliminated, the next
      wave spawns.



      To better manage the flow of enemies coming to you, try
      Pushing an enemy to gain some time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3166127235072
    m_Localized: "This enemy looks way too strong to be killed by the Sword. \n\nTry
      pushing it into a Hole, eliminating them in an instant, regardless of their
      health !"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
